constraints:
1 < N < 10^{6}
1 < K < 10^{6}
1 < arr[i] < 10^{6}

expected time complexity: O(Log_{3}N)
expected auxiliary space: O(1)

standard_solution_code:
class Solution:

	def ternarySearch(self, arr, N, K):
		flag = 0
		for i in range(N):
			if arr[i] == K:
				flag = 1
		if flag == 1:
			return 1
		else:
			return -1
